ype":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"性能基准测试：利用 LiteSVM 的速度，在开发和 CI/CD 流水线中运行全面的测试套件","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":4,"offset":698},"end":{"line":20,"column":50,"offset":744}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":4,"offset":698},"end":{"line":20,"column":50,"offset":744}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":695},"end":{"line":20,"column":50,"offset":744}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"加入社区：在 Discord 上与其他使用 LiteSVM 的开发者交流，分享测试策略和优化方法","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":749},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":797}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":749},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":797}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":746},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":797}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"保持更新：关注 ","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":4,"offset":802},"end":{"line":22,"column":12,"offset":810}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://github.com/LiteSVM/litesvm","children":[{"type":"text","value":"LiteSVM 仓库","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":13,"offset":811},"end":{"line":22,"column":23,"offset":821}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":12,"offset":810},"end":{"line":22,"column":60,"offset":858}}},{"type":"text","value":"，了解最新功能、语言绑定和性能改进","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":60,"offset":858},"end":{"line":22,"column":77,"offset":875}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":4,"offset":802},"end":{"line":22,"column":77,"offset":875}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":799},"end":{"line":22,"column":77,"offset":875}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1,"offset":588},"end":{"line":22,"column":77,"offset":875}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"特别感谢 ","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":881},"end":{"line":24,"column":8,"offset":886}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://x.com/exoaursen","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Aursen","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":9,"offset":887},"end":{"line":24,"column":15,"offset":893}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":8,"offset":886},"end":{"line":24,"column":41,"offset":919}}},{"type":"text","value":" 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":41,"offset":919},"end":{"line":24,"column":44,"offset":922}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://x.com/exotic_markets_","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exotic Markets","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":45,"offset":923},"end":{"line":24,"column":59,"offset":937}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":44,"offset":922},"end":{"line":24,"column":91,"offset":969}}},{"type":"text","value":" 团队创建并维护了 LiteSVM，使高性能的 Solana 程序测试对多语言开发者变得触手可及。","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":91,"offset":969},"end":{"line":24,"column":140,"offset":1018}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":881},"end":{"line":24,"column":140,"offset":1018}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1,"offset":879},"end":{"line":24,"column":140,"offset":1018}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":24,"column":140,"offset":1018}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 结论\r\n\r\n恭喜你！你已经完成了《使用 LiteSVM 进行测试》课程。现在，你已经全面了解了如何使用 LiteSVM 这一快速轻量的测试框架，将 Solana 虚拟机直接引入测试流程，实现快速迭代和精准的程序测试。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"你学到了什么\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在本课程中，你掌握了 LiteSVM 的核心概念：\r\n- **性能优势**：了解 LiteSVM 的进程内虚拟机如何比传统测试框架提供显著更快的执行速度\r\n- **账户管理**：创建和配置系统账户、程序账户以及 SPL 代币账户，以实现全面的测试场景\r\n- **交易执行**：设置、模拟并执行交易，同时正确检查结果\r\n- **高级控制**：操作系统变量、控制运行时行为以及自定义测试环境\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"下一步\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n现在，你已经具备使用 LiteSVM 为 Solana 程序构建快速可靠测试的能力！以下是一些推荐的下一步行动：\r\n1. 应用到你的项目中：将 LiteSVM 集成到现有的 Solana 程序测试套件中，亲身体验性能提升\r\n2. 探索高级测试：利用 LiteSVM 的账户操作功能，测试其他框架难以重现的复杂边界情况和失败场景\r\n3. 性能基准测试：利用 LiteSVM 的速度，在开发和 CI/CD 流水线中运行全面的测试套件\r\n4. 加入社区：在 Discord 上与其他使用 LiteSVM 的开发者交流，分享测试策略和优化方法\r\n5. 保持更新：关注 [LiteSVM 仓库](https://github.com/LiteSVM/litesvm)，了解最新功能、语言绑定和性能改进\r\n\r\n> 特别感谢 [Aursen](https://x.com/exoaursen) 和 [Exotic Markets](https://x.com/exotic_markets_) 团队创建并维护了 LiteSVM，使高性能的 Solana 程序测试对多语言开发者变得触手可及。","highlightedCode":{}}